      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i really dont want to go to the doctor right now its so expensive and i have work tomorrow. i have some old clotrimazole cream from a few years ago in my cabinet, do u think i can just use that for a few days and see if it goes away? its not like it's hurting much, just itchy and a bit weird feeling.",
